irc-serve (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First stable release: 0.8.0's federation paths plus the audit backlog
  * (SASL refusal flush, CHOPER/INVITE resolution, channel-verb hardening),
  * IRCv3 compliance sweep, binary release artifacts (linux-x64 + macos-arm64
  * x TLS on/off), and a fixed fed-staging deploy pipeline. No wire change
  * since 0.8.0.

